{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Type Property","externalID":"s:21TelemetryDeckEncoding0aB12BatchEncoderV10batchLimit12PropertyJSON0dG0VvpZ","title":"batchLimit","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"batchLimit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchLimit","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV"}],"modules":[{"name":"TelemetryDeckEncoding"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder.swift#L134"}},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/telemetrydeckencoding\/telemetrydeckbatchencoder\/batchlimit"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"TelemetryDeck’s limits on one request: 100 events and 1,000,000 bytes of body, and 333,333"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bytes of one event."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchLimit"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON\/BatchLimit","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BatchLimit","preciseIdentifier":"s:12PropertyJSON10BatchLimitV"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The 100 events are what TelemetryDeck’s SwiftSDK sends in a request. The 333,333 bytes of an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event are a third of Ingest API v3’s limit: TelemetryDeck refuses a whole request when one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event’s JSON is over 1,000,000 bytes as its server writes it, which may be larger than the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encoder’s, and a third leaves room for the escapes a re-encoder commonly adds, such as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\u"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and four hex digits for a character outside ASCII, and a space after each ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":","},{"text":". A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"larger event is left out as ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TelemetryDeck documents no limit on a request; its 1,000,000 bytes are the encoder’s own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bound, the most one event may be, which keeps a request to a size a retry can send again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding","doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder"]]},"references":{"doc://TelemetryDeckEncoding/documentation/TelemetryDeckEncoding":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding","url":"\/documentation\/telemetrydeckencoding","role":"collection","title":"TelemetryDeckEncoding","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Send records to TelemetryDeck as signals, through its Ingest API v3.","type":"text"}]},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/BatchEncoder":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BatchEncoder"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What turns a batch of records into the requests "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" sends."}],"url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/batchencoder","role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BatchEncoder"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"BatchEncoder","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder"},"doc://PropertyJSON/documentation/PropertyJSON/BatchLimit":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The most an ingestion endpoint takes in one request: how many records, how many bytes of body,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and how many bytes of one record’s JSON."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BatchLimit","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"BatchLimit","url":"\/documentation\/propertyjson\/batchlimit","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON\/BatchLimit","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchLimit","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://TelemetryDeckEncoding/documentation/TelemetryDeckEncoding/TelemetryDeckEncodingError/oversized(byteCount:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/telemetrydeckencoding\/telemetrydeckencodingerror\/oversized(bytecount:)","abstract":[{"text":"The event’s JSON is ","type":"text"},{"code":"byteCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" bytes, more than the encoder’s limit lets one record hold:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"333,333 bytes by default (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"), a third of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TelemetryDeck’s 1,000,000. Only ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaves a record out for it.","type":"text"}],"title":"TelemetryDeckEncodingError.oversized(byteCount:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"oversized","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"byteCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckEncodingError\/oversized(byteCount:)"},"doc://TelemetryDeckEncoding/documentation/TelemetryDeckEncoding/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder/requests(for:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"code":"batch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as the requests TelemetryDeck takes, each within the encoder’s limit, with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"records left out of them.","type":"text"}],"title":"requests(for:)","url":"\/documentation\/telemetrydeckencoding\/telemetrydeckbatchencoder\/requests(for:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/documentation\/TelemetryDeckEncoding\/TelemetryDeckBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requests"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","text":"EventRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations13BatchRequestsV","text":"BatchRequests"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier